{"unit_id":"linglanxin__codex-dsh-bridge#feature-1","repo":"linglanxin/codex-dsh-bridge","commit":"43cd01ee21a73512977f4b45f3522d6f9cfc6375","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-mcp-bridge 的功能「监督任务」：通过 MCP 启动受监督的 DSH 任务，读取持久化任务状态、问题、输出和事件；成果文件变化会使已接受结果失效。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mcp.ts:9","src/coordinator.ts:22"]}
